220	/**
221	 * Accept an invitation. This is the ONLY path that creates a Membership for
222	 * someone other than an org's creator, and it runs as the invitee — clicking
223	 * Accept while signed in as the invited address *is* the consent.
224	 *
225	 * Must be triggered by a deliberate click, never on page load: a mutation that
226	 * fires when the emailed URL is merely opened (or prefetched) would join people
227	 * to organizations without their agreement all over again.
